From 7a55262269019150db7fac2a499f84ac55052f25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:30:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Align upgrade CI release tags and busy handoff
 scenarios

Fetch both stable upstream tag eras even when calver already resolves. The handoff fixture waited for an update drain that idle-only pre-swap correctly refuses; assert refusal, finish the worker, then retry idle. Preserve the >180s worker drain regression in an explicit real socket drain with a 300s fixture cap rather than the incompatible 120s cap.

Proof: tag routing regression RED on old workflow; focused resolver/routing/verdict suites GREEN (36 tests); full scripts/check passes. Real namespace handoff proof requires dispatch CI; shared-worker userns policy left untouched.
---
